><mtr><mtd><msup><mn>37</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>90</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∠</mi><mi>R</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>180</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∠</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>37</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>90</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∠</mi><mi>R</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>53</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>.</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Hence, the triangles are similar, and</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"63\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 18.422em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2220\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D43E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2245\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2220\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D443 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 2em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2220\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D43F TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2245\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2220\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D444 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 2em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2220\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D440 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2245\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2220\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D445 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd></mjx-mtr></mjx-itable></mjx-table></mjx-mtable></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mtable displaystyle=\"true\" columnalign=\"right\" columnspacing=\"\" rowspacing=\"3pt\"><mtr><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∠</mi><mi>K</mi><mo>≅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∠</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>,</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace></mstyle><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∠</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>≅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∠</mi><mi>Q</mi><mo>,</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace></mstyle><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∠</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>≅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∠</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>.</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>So, we conclude that </p>\n<ul>\n<li><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"64\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D43E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>K</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> corresponds to <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" c